\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: 11/04/89\ \ \ \ \ author: margreet sanders\\
Widened model to allow for indobjrels too (otherwise, the filter is not 
consistent with the transformation); removed CApairs mentioning nominative case 
(were a relic from Dutch; in English, the default value is []. Again, there was 
an inconsistency with the transformation).
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
